# Normalize all text files to LF in the object store, independent of each
# clone's core.autocrlf. Without this, git inside the Linux lint container
# sees every CRLF working-tree file on a Windows checkout as modified and
# scans the whole tree as "changed".
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
Ansible/runner/* text eol=lf
Ansible/host-cleanup/* text eol=lf
# git archive (Updatepaket, Offline-Bundle) schreibt Commit und Commitdatum in
# die Build-Kennung des MECM-Serverpakets; ein Checkout behaelt die Platzhalter.
Powershell-MECM/BUILD.json export-subst
